{"id":9,"date":"2016-05-16T12:50:28","date_gmt":"2016-05-16T12:50:28","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/masterbadminton.dev\/yonex-all-england-2012-qualifying-rounds-latest-news\/"},"modified":"2016-08-31T07:47:57","modified_gmt":"2016-08-31T07:47:57","slug":"all-england-2012-qualifying-rounds-news-html","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/masterbadminton.com\/all-england-2012-qualifying-rounds-news.html","title":{"rendered":"Yonex All England 2012 Qualifying Rounds Latest News"},"content":{"rendered":"<div id=\"ContentColumn\">\n<div class=\"Liner\">\n<div style=\"float: left;\"><\/div>\n<p>Players battled hard to qualify for the Super Series Premier tournament at the Preliminary Rounds of the Yonex All England 2012.<\/p>\n<p>This is big. Big for the players who want to qualify for the Olympics!<\/p>\n<p>The Super Series Premier hands players a rare chance to score big ranking points and hope for entering the Olympics.<\/p>\n<h3>Malaysians are looking strong at the All England Open 2012<\/h3>\n<p>11 Malaysians got through and will compete at the First Rounds of the tournament.<\/p>\n<p>Among those who qualified are:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Darren Liew<\/b> and <b>Chong Wei Feng<\/b> in men&#8217;s singles<\/li>\n<li><b>Mohd Zakry Abdul Latif\/Mohd Fairuzizuan Mohd Tazari<\/b> and <b>Goh V-Shem\/Teo Kok Siang<\/b> in men&#8217;s doubles.<\/li>\n<li><b>Goh Liu Ying\/Lim Yin Loo<\/b> and the Ng sisters, <b>Ng Hui Lin\/Ng Hui Ern<\/b> in women&#8217;s doubles.<\/li>\n<li><b>Ong Jian Guo\/Lim Yin Loo<\/b> in mixed doubles.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>These players will be joining top guns like Lee Chong Wei and Koo Kien Keat\/Tan Boon Heong in the First Rounds tomorrow.<\/p>\n<h3>Post Match Interview with Malaysia&#8217;s Local Badminton Stars, the Ng Sisters<\/h3>\n<p>A short but interesting interview was conducted with Ng Hui Lin\/Ng Hui Ern of Malaysia. They are known as the Ng sisters in Malaysia because they are sisters! Currently studying in the UK, Hui Lin and Hui Ern are part time professional shuttlers.<\/p>\n<p>Ng\/Ng defeated a better pair than them in terms of world ranking, Nicole Grether\/Charmaine Reid of Canada in 2 straight games (21-18, 22-20).<\/p>\n<div align=\"center\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/bzM-te8pyMY\" width=\"420\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/div>\n<h3>Tough but Victorious Day for Viktor Axelsen<\/h3>\n<p>Victor (aged 17) had a tough day at the preliminary rounds of the Yonex All England 2012.<\/p>\n<p>Nothing came easy for Viktor&#8217;s FIRST All England Open.<\/p>\n<p>Both his opponents forced him into a rubber. With the extra third game against both players, it meant the young Dane played a total of 6 games!<\/p>\n<p>In addition to his tough qualification day, Viktor is going to face Kenichi Tago (JPN) at tomorrow&#8217;s First Rounds.<\/p>\n<p>It&#8217;s going to be even tougher for the Dane.<\/p>\n<p>The young Danish star had once before beaten the legendary Taufik Hidayat. Let&#8217;s hear what he has to say.<\/p>\n<div align=\"center\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/Iwu1ZDCyVpk\" width=\"420\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/div>\n<h3>Interesting Matches on Day 2: Round of 32 of the Yonex All England 2012?<\/h3>\n<p>The big guns have yet to meet each other so most of tomorrow&#8217;s matches appear to be one sided.<\/p>\n<p>It should be easy to predict who&#8217;s going to win. But we&#8217;ll look out for any surprises.<\/p>\n<p>However, the good matches you might want to pay attention to are:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Kenichi Tago<\/b> (JPN) v Viktor Axelsen (DEN)<\/li>\n<li><b>Chan Peng Soon\/Goh Liu Ying<\/b> (MAS) v <b>Diju V\/Jwala Gutta<\/b> (IND)<\/li>\n<li><b>Zhang Nan\/Zhao Yun Lei<\/b> (CHN) v <b>Chris Adcock\/Imogen Bankier<\/b> (ENG)<\/li>\n<li><b>Yip Pui Yin <\/b>(HKG) v <b>Inthanon Ratchanok<\/b> (THA)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>I guess these will be the most competitive and interesting matches of the day.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"all-england-badminton-championships-2012-announcement.html\">Go to our announcement page for more details on the competition, how to watch it live, and ticket information<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Check out the <a href=\"yonex-all-england-championships-2012-event-program.html\">event program<\/a> for the match schedules.<\/p>\n<div class=\"retnvbx1\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"fb-comments-intro-ns\">\n<div class=\"retnvbx\"><\/div>\n<h3><span class=\"teelmeww\">Tell me what you think!<\/span><\/h3>\n<p>What do you think about what you just read? Leave me a comment below.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div id=\"COMMENTING\" class=\"fb-comment\">\n<div class=\"fb-comments\" data-href=\"http:\/\/www.how-to-play-badminton.com\/all-england-2012-qualifying-rounds-news.html\" data-num-posts=\"15\" data-width=\"100%\"><\/div>\n<h3 class=\"fblikeste\">Like Masterbadminton.com?<\/h3>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div id=\"fb-root\"><\/div>\n<p><script><![CDATA[\n(function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(d.getElementById(id)){return;}js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\"..\/connect.facebook.net\/en_US\/all.js#xfbml=1\";fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}(document,'script','facebook-jssdk'));\n><\/script>\n\n\n<div align=\"left\"><\/div>\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n\n<div align=\"center\"><\/div>\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Players battled hard to qualify for the Super Series Premier tournament at the Preliminary Rounds of the Yonex All England 2012. This is big. Big for the players who want to qualify for the Olympics! The Super Series Premier hands players a rare chance to score big ranking points and hope for entering the Olympics. [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[22],"tags":[],"class_list":["post